  "num_edges": 35,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "post_id": "552807874192482305",
      "text": "TWITTER.  Charlie Hebdo is a racist publication.  Murderers murdering people are not justified in murdering people. Crazy paradox, I know.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:44:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552989597433475072",
      "text": "@jlish1990 @leninology I actually agree with the article but these comments really do have troubling implications as you said.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:46:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529860315162911e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552813423567048706",
      "text": "@theOliJones it is.  It's telling that I think people are tacitly acknowleding that Charlie Hebdo's racism *might* be a factor here.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:06:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5281312081762304e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552811377103212544",
      "text": "@johannes_rath context is all.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:57:57 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5281087046066176e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552952012396965888",
      "text": "@leninology Why say it then? To offer context? If you think that is the context of these acts you're desperately misguided.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 22:16:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5282243224418714e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552815566382055425",
      "text": "@leninology ...and the only logical conclusion is justification. You could understand why people should find that so abhorrent.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:14:36 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528134235670487e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552991907459399680",
      "text": "@MW_Lowe I only saw a tweet retweeted into my timeline. Will have to find article. Obviously I agree with that sentiment",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:55:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529908314400686e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552828735859478528",
      "text": "@johannes_rath If that context mattered in 'the last few days', it matters today.  I have no time for 'a decent interval' etc.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:06:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52827890732372e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552822432244187136",
      "text": "@theOliJones \"the only logical conclusion is justification\".  Of course, that is not logical.  There's a long history of such non-sequiturs.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:41:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528155663820554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552863087104376832",
      "text": "@leninology @johannes_rath I refer you to the dictionary (and not Wikipedia)",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:23:26 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5286258285257114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825671693897729",
      "text": "@johannes_rath No, it isn't. If the only context you care about is one that excludes the racist demonisation of Islam, you are useless to me",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:54:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528252722535711e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552808283551977473",
      "text": "@leninology so hard for ppl to get heads round. What? You can oppose racism and idiots shooting journalists? Really??! #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:45:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528078741924823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552865253672108032",
      "text": "@leninology @BlueMerleBill There are no human races.Sorting human beings into different races is the very definition of #racism",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:32:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5286258285257114e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553007346470109186",
      "text": "@jlish1990 yes it seems to of been the timing of it that caused all of the furore he is now responding to in a pretty disheartening manner.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 01:56:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529919074593997e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552986031516291072",
      "text": "@MW_Lowe @leninology @johannes_rath I know... Yet to get a satisfactory response.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:31:58 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529855139727483e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552810705259220993",
      "text": "@leninology @FeministaJones hmm hmm",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:55:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528078741924823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552810870460661760",
      "text": "@leninology I cannot see why making fun of Islam is in itself racist, though it may be definitely motivated by racism. #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:55:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528078741924823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552936916862402560",
      "text": "@jlish1990 @johannes_rath \"if it was the official magazine of the BNP it would have been just as bad\".  Speak for yourself.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:16:48 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52935193687126e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552944077411729408",
      "text": "@johannes_rath @leninology no not your tweet, the one you replied to",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:45:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529439494561096e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552935193687126016",
      "text": "@leninology @johannes_rath if it was the official magazine of the BNP it would have been just as bad. What purpose does your tweet serve?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:09:57 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5281137710321254e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552861858773082113",
      "text": "@leninology @johannes_rath Islam isn't a race. It's a religion.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:18:33 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528256716938977e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552825272253571073",
      "text": "@leninology You may label anti-cleric jokes stupid,but calling it racist is off the mark, in today's context.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:53:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528227819400888e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552822238958088193",
      "text": "@leninology What about your own tweet and its context? #CharlieHebdo",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:41:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5281137710321254e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552958208881721344",
      "text": "@theOliJones I think it is *unquestionably* the context of the media/political response to this.  So so obviously.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 22:41:25 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529520123969659e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552862582852571137",
      "text": "@BlueMerleBill @johannes_rath name all the races for me. Describe what makes a race. Then we can assess your point.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 16:21:26 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528618587730821e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552822781940088832",
      "text": "@johannes_rath The context of rabid Islamophobia to which the tweet referred is pretty obvious, no?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:43:16 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528222389580882e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552815193961414657",
      "text": "@leninology Might yes. But seeing that tweet people think, why are you saying this in relation to what's just happened...",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:13:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528134235670487e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552985513972748288",
      "text": "@leninology @jlish1990 @johannes_rath wow.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:29:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5293691686240256e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552808049883504640",
      "text": "@leninology Some people just need to get a sense of humour.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 12:44:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528078741924823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552943949456109569",
      "text": "@jlish1990 @leninology My tweet?",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:44:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.52935193687126e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552813120817623040",
      "text": "@leninology And yet if your first reaction to hearing about the shooting is to tweet that it is a racist mag, that in itself is telling.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:04:53 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528078741924823e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552990831440068608",
      "text": "@jlish1990 the article he wrote about how the media shouldn't use this attack as an excuse to scapegoat Muslims. He tweeted it earlier.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:51:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5299000937744384e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552827890732371969",
      "text": "@leninology If you want to find out about what I care,check out my posts from the last days.Hint:do some research on #Pegida &amp; #nopegida",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 14:03:34 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528256716938977e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552822586338709504",
      "text": "@theOliJones It's basically a variant of \"you're with us or against us\".  Well understood reflex of authoritarians.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 13:42:30 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.528155663820554e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552990009377443840",
      "text": "@MW_Lowe @leninology what article are you referring to?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 00:47:46 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.529895974334751e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "552937117824090112",
      "text": "@leninology @johannes_rath so you're saying that they would be more deserving of death? Troubling implication",
      "timestamp": "Wed Jan 07 21:17:36 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5293691686240256e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
